msgid ""
"Activity tracking events for Qiskit Runtime {#activity-tracking-events-for-"
"qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr ""
"Event pelacakan aktivitas untuk Qiskit Runtime {#activity-tracking-events-"
"for-qiskit-runtime}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate activity tracking "
"events.\n"
msgstr ""
"Layanan IBM Cloud&reg;, seperti Qiskit Runtime, menghasilkan event pelacakan"
" aktivitas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a "
"service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal "
"activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit "
"requirements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Event pelacakan aktivitas melaporkan aktivitas yang mengubah status layanan "
"di IBM Cloud. Kamu bisa menggunakan event ini untuk menyelidiki aktivitas "
"yang tidak biasa, tindakan kritis, dan memenuhi persyaratan audit "
"regulasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to"
" route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by "
"configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events "
"are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events"
" Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa menggunakan IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, sebuah "
"layanan platform, untuk mengarahkan event audit di akunmu ke tujuan yang "
"kamu pilih dengan mengonfigurasi target dan rute yang menentukan ke mana "
"event pelacakan aktivitas dikirim. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat "
"[Tentang IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events "
"Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are "
"generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event "
"Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa menggunakan IBM Cloud Logs untuk memvisualisasikan dan memberi "
"peringatan pada event yang dihasilkan di akunmu dan diarahkan oleh IBM Cloud"
" Activity Tracker Event Routing ke instans IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

